# Regenerate the README GIF:  vhs docs/demo/demo.tape
Output docs/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 17
Set Width 1000
Set Height 330
Set Padding 24
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Hide
Type "source docs/demo/setup.sh && clear"
Enter
Show

Sleep 800ms
Type "cd ~/dev/acme/api && claude"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2.2s

Type "cd ~/dev/side-project && claude"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2.2s

Type "cd ~/dev/acme/api && cprof which"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2.2s

Type "cprof list"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 4s
